sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AuthorService
    participant AuthorRepository
    participant Database
    participant Author

    Client->>+AuthorService: insertAuthor(author)
    Note right of Client: Client calls AuthorService.insert with Author object

    AuthorService->>+AuthorRepository: saveAuthor(author)
    Note right of AuthorService: AuthorService delegates to repository.save

    AuthorRepository->>+Database: INSERT INTO authors VALUES ...
    Note right of AuthorRepository: Repository persists author to database

    Database->>+Author: return persisted Author with ID
    Note right of Database: Author object with generated ID

    Author-->>-Database: Author (with ID)

    Database-->>-AuthorRepository: Author (with ID)
    Note right of AuthorRepository: Persisted Author returned to repository

    AuthorRepository-->>-AuthorService: Author (with ID)
    Note right of AuthorService: Persisted Author returned to service

    AuthorService-->>-Client: Author (with ID)
    Note right of Client: Persisted Author returned to client
